# Authored on Windows, built on ubuntu-latest in CI. Normalise to LF in the repository so the
# two never disagree about what a file's contents are — a CRLF/LF mismatch shows up as a whole
# file rewritten in a diff, which buries the actual change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text. Let git leave them alone.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
